WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Sungula endlwini, zone ya 0. Ehleketa hi tindhawu leti u ti endzelaka ngopfu.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Veka ntanga wa khixi ekusuhi na nyangwa eka zone ya 1. U wu endzela siku na siku.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Veka mirhi ya mihandzu ekusuhi eka zone ya 2. U yi hlayisa masiku yo tala.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Nsimu leyikulu yi le kule eka zone ya 3. Yi endzele loko swi laveka.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Endzela xihlahla xa tihunyi eka zone ya 4 nkarhi na nkarhi. Tshika zone ya 5 yi ri nhova.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Mati, swiganga na tindlela swi vumba ti-zone. Hlawula leti ringanaka ndhawu ya wena.
